{
  "//": [
    "Shepherdr's features list (3.1.1): every feature the layout ships, on both sides. Each has its shared logic (core/<name>.js,",
    "or the service's service/<file> where herdr-core itself is the logic), its Herdr side (the mods it lives in, or a Herdr",
    "built-in) and its web side (files under web/: 2.1's screens and plugins, and web/src/screens). test/test_repo.py checks it:",
    "a feature missing a side, a mod that belongs to no feature, or a listed file that isn't there fails CI. \"planned\" says what",
    "its web side still lacks; none may be left when 3.1.1 is released.",
    "addon: the add-on in lib/addons.json; off there means off on both sides. view_only: per-device look, no shared logic."
  ],
